SUMMARY:Soundstreams presents Steve Reich at 90!
DESCRIPTION:TORONTO ARTS & CULTURE\n{ Concert is sold-out }\n\n**Soundstre
 ams** exists to strengthen public engagement with new Canadian music and m
 usic theatre/opera through commissioning\, developing\, producing\, and di
 sseminating that music. We aim to inspire\, foster\, and enable excellence
  at the highest international standards.\n\nLet's enjoy the season opening
  concert!!\n\nOct. 6\, 2026\, 7:30pm\, Koerner Hall.\nIn collaboration wit
 h Faculty of Music\, University of Toronto\n\nhttps://stevereich.com/\n\n*
 *Steve Reich** has been described as “our greatest living composer” (N
 Y Times). We celebrate his 90th birthday with the North American premiere 
 of *In All Your Ways* for 14 instruments\, co-commissioned by Soundstreams
 \, Carnegie Hall\, Edinburgh Festival\, Philharmonie de Paris and others.\
 n\nThe program includes two legendary signature masterpieces: *Music for 1
 8 Musicians* and *Clapping Music*\, all performed by some of the world’s
  greatest interpreters of his music. *Clapping Music* features an exclusiv
 e screening with Reich performing one of the parts on film and **Russell H
 artenberger** performing the other live on stage.\n\n***Ticket link/More i
 nfo here: ($35-$95)***\n\nhttps://soundstreams.ca/events/celebrating-steve
 -reich-at-90/\n\nhttps://www.rcmusic.com/concert/soundstreams-presents-ste
 ve-reich-at-90-455401\n\nhttps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Steve_Reich\n\nDon'
 t miss out on this concert experience...I'm sitting in the Lower Balcony.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/toronto-arts-and-culture/events/31573
 5298/
