SUMMARY:October ART Crawl: Tour 3 top West End private galleries/spaces ($
 10 per person)
DESCRIPTION:TORONTO ARTS & CULTURE\nWe will continue with our monthly **Ar
 t Crawls**!\n\n***Please read everything over first.***\n\n\\*\\*\\*Our on
 ly ART Crawl in October will be on Saturday 10th (12:30pm-2:30pm)\n\nThis 
 is the Saturday of **Thanksgiving** long weekend. Note: the **12:30pm STAR
 T**-time.\n\n16 people/members each time.\n\n**$10 per person.**\n\n**\\*\
 \*\\*Sent via e-transfer when you signup/rsvp.**\n\n**I'm not able to HOLD
  space for you.**\n\n***--We will visit 3 different*** (downtown/west end/
 east end) galleries each month **(with short walks between each one)**\n\n
 Each month will be different galleries and/or artist-run centres.\n\n\\*\\
 *We'll meet the Gallery owners/artists/directors--who will lead us in tour
 s and conversation at each stop.\n\nNO weather cancellations---**we will c
 arry on!**\n\nNO cancellations/no refunds or any [re-scheduling](http://re
 -scheduling...if/) if you cannot make it.\n\n\\-\\-\\-Check your calendars
  and PLAN ahead if you can join us\\-\\-and please arrive on time\\. We're
  not able to wait for you\\. Sorry\\.\n\nAre you Interested in ART/artists
 --**and learning/visiting the exceptional local galleries we have in Toron
 to? With other MEETUP members**\n\nSaturday October 10th ***(12:30pm-2:30p
 m)***\n\nOnce I have 16 **confirmations** from Meetup members (you)--I wil
 l email you the start location of our ART Crawl!! Next week.\n\n**Our firs
 t stop**. Bloor/Lansdowne (we then head WEST)\n\nIf interested\, please em
 ail me $10.\n\nInclude your first name only\, and email address for a repl
 y.\n\n**I will then confirm you.**\n\nAnd will firm up our itinerary with 
 you in a few days.\n\nSee you on Saturday October 10th--if you're confirme
 d--watch for an email directly from me!!\n\n***We will do this again in No
 vember*** and ongoing all Winter---as we find some interesting spaces and 
 exhibitions.\n\nEach month will be posted separately.\n\n**October 2026 is
  posted now.**\n\nYou can email me directly here:\n\ntorontoisculture@gmai
 l\,com\n\nGreg\nThanks\n\n(Please understand I have NO space for any guest
 s you may wish to bring with you. I am limited in group size based on the 
 GALLERY instructions)
